# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Azure Functions (local development)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# local.settings.json in src/CreditUnion.Batch.Functions is intentionally tracked:
# it holds only Azurite dev-storage settings and no secrets.
__blobstorage__/
__queuestorage__/
__azurite_db*__.json
azurite/
.azurite/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Test data that the broad rules above would hide. Keep these last: the last
# matching rule wins. Without them a fresh clone lacks the golden evidence
# files and the standard-day ".tmp" input, and 34 tests fail (progress.md, Phase 9).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
!tests/TestData/golden/**/evidence/
!tests/TestData/inputs/**/*.tmp
